# Phase 7: Integrations, Release & Operations

> **Precondition:** Phase 6 gate verified.
> **Outputs:** production stack, pinned integrations, release automation, runbooks,
> a fresh-clone proof, and one real critical-flow transaction.
>
> Pack items below are labeled `(pack: …)`. When a pack is disabled, mark its items
> `Skipped on purpose` with a revisit trigger — never delete them.

---

## Deliverables & Tasks

- [ ] **7.1 Third-party integrations**
  - Analytics (consent-gated), error monitoring, email, and any domain service;
    exporter destination for telemetry (`OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT`) when the
    OTel pack is enabled.
  - **Acceptance:** each integration initializes only when its env vars exist and
    emits a test event in development.
  - **Negative:** with consent denied, no analytics request is sent; a missing
    exporter endpoint degrades to a no-op, never a crash.
  - **Evidence:** event/probe output per integration
  - **Result:** —

- [ ] **7.2 Pinned integration matrix**
  - Pin every dependency; record source, version, and hash where available.
  - **Acceptance:** the installer/verifier reports `N/N OK`; a version change on
    one side of a duplicated fact fails the check.
  - **Negative:** an upstream republish with a changed archive fails the build
    loudly instead of silently changing the image.
  - **Evidence:** manifest count, verification output
  - **Result:** —

- [ ] **7.3 Production backend + state (pack: woocommerce)**
  - Compose the storefront, WordPress/WooCommerce backend, and database; named
    volumes for core/MySQL; `mu-plugins` and `uploads.ini` bind-mounted;
    `WORDPRESS_CONFIG_EXTRA` carries `WP_HOME`, `WP_SITEURL`,
    `GRAPHQL_JWT_AUTH_SECRET_KEY`, `DISABLE_WP_CRON`, `WP_POST_REVISIONS=false`.
  - **Acceptance:** `docker compose config` valid; `up -d` reaches all-healthy;
    `/graphql` answers a catalog query; data survives `down`/`up`.
  - **Negative:** a missing `GRAPHQL_JWT_AUTH_SECRET_KEY` fails startup instead of
    minting unverifiable tokens.
  - **Idempotency:** re-running the patch script keeps `pdo_mysql`/WP-CLI and
    `/wp-admin` at 200 after container recreation.
  - **Evidence:** service list, health status, query output, patch re-run
  - **Result:** —

- [ ] **7.4 Production stack**
  - Compose file with app, backend, database; bind-mounted state; env template;
    healthchecks; log rotation; restart policy; edge routing labels.
  - **Acceptance:** `docker compose config` is valid; `up -d` reaches all-healthy;
    data survives `down`/`up`.
  - **Negative:** a missing required env value fails startup instead of running
    with a default secret.
  - **Evidence:** service list, health status, persistence check
  - **Result:** —

- [ ] **7.5 Release automation**
  - Multi-arch images, digest recording, changelog, gated release.
  - **Acceptance:** `docker buildx imagetools inspect` shows every target
    platform; the release notes contain both digests.
  - **Negative:** a failing gate produces no tag and no release.
  - **Evidence:** manifest digest, platforms, release URL
  - **Result:** —

- [ ] **7.6 Operator documentation**
  - Architecture, routing, migration, updates, troubleshooting, verification.
  - **Acceptance:** every document's commands were executed once and match the
    actual files.
  - **Evidence:** doc list, one transcript per runbook
  - **Result:** —

- [ ] **7.7 Critical-flow proof (pack: woocommerce)**
  - One real end-to-end transaction through the production-shaped stack.
  - **Acceptance:** catalog → login → cart → `/checkout/?fill_cart=…` → gateway
    callback (`/wc-api/<Gateway>/` → 307) → order visible on `/account`.
  - **Negative:** an expired JWT or missing `woocommerce-session` yields a guest
    empty cart, not a silent half-order.
  - **Evidence:** order ID, callback status, `/account` screenshot
  - **Result:** —

- [ ] **7.8 Fresh-clone proof**
  - Clone to a new directory (and a clean host for production).
  - **Acceptance:** the documented dev flow and production flow both work with
    zero undocumented steps.
  - **Evidence:** timings, screenshots, command transcript
  - **Result:** —

- [ ] **7.9 Final audit**
  - **Acceptance:** every item has a hash or `manual`; no required item is
    unchecked; no secret in git history; every deferred item and disabled pack has
    a trigger; every enabled pack's gate evidence is present.
  - **Evidence:** audit output, secret scan result, pack evidence list
  - **Result:** —

---

**Phase 7 gate:** a fresh clone reproduces the site; production starts from a
copied directory with valid TLS, healthy services, an exported trace (or a
recorded OTel deferral), and a completed critical flow.

> **Gate verified YYYY-MM-DD (7.1–7.9):** [image digests, health status, trace
> export, order ID, fresh-clone result, audit result].
